  "problems": "Chart is published only as an image (https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0269/4076/8349/files/AGOLDE_SIZE_CHART_WEBSITE.jpg, 1002x1012); values read visually. It is numerically identical to the Citizens of Humanity women's chart (same parent company). Letter labels published as X-SMALL..X-LARGE (abbreviated XS..XL), each spanning two denim sizes; 22, 23, 34 have no letter; 22-24 have no US size; US 10 spans 30-31, US 12 spans 32-33. Inches also published (bust 29 1/2..41 1/2, waist 22 1/2..34 1/2, hip 32 1/2..44 1/2). The 'How to Measure' block on the Fit Guide 2.0 page mixes body (waist) and garment (rise, inseam, leg opening) instructions, and its embedded size-chart images are broken placeholders. No per-size inseam."
